{"seq":1,"slug":"props-and-events","title":"Props 与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/props-and-events","wordCount":521,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"props-与事件\">Props 与事件</h1><h2 id=\"组件通信基础\">组件通信基础</h2><p>Props 和事件是 Vue 组件间最基本的通信方式，遵循<strong>单向数据流</strong>原则：props 向下传递数据，事件向上传递消息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[&quot;父组件&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;子组件&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; |&quot;props(数据向下)&quot;| C&#10;    C --&gt; |&quot;emit(事件向上)&quot;| P\">flowchart TD\n    P[\"父组件\"]\n    C[\"子组件\"]\n    P --&gt; |\"props(数据向下)\"| C\n    C --&gt; |\"emit(事件向上)\"| P</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>单向数据流</strong>：数据经 props 向下、变更经事件向上，子组件不直接改写父组件状态。</li>\n<li><strong>props</strong>：父组件传给子组件的输入，是只读的；在子组件内修改会被警告。</li>\n<li><strong>事件契约</strong>：<code>defineEmits</code> 声明组件会抛出的事件名与载荷类型，是父子之间的公开接口。</li>\n<li><strong>验证方式</strong>：类型声明在编译期检查并给出完整 TS 支持，运行时声明支持 <code>validator</code>，二者可互补。</li>\n<li><strong>v-model</strong>：<code>modelValue</code> prop 与 <code>update:modelValue</code> 事件的语法糖，<code>defineModel</code> 进一步封装为可读写 ref。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"props-验证\">Props 验证</h2><h3 id=\"类型声明\">类型声明</h3><p>在 <code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 中使用 TypeScript 接口声明 props 类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Props {&#10;  title: string;&#10;  count?: number;&#10;  status: &#39;active&#39; | &#39;inactive&#39; | &#39;pending&#39;;&#10;  items: Array&lt;{ id: number; name: string }&gt;;&#10;  callback?: (value: string) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const props = withDefaults(defineProps&lt;Props&gt;(), {&#10;  count: 0,&#10;  items: () =&gt; [],&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Props {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count?: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  status: 'active' | 'inactive' | 'pending';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: Array&#x3C;{ id: number; name: string }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  callback?: (value: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = withDefaults(defineProps&#x3C;Props>(), {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: () => [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"运行时验证\">运行时验证</h3><p>当需要更复杂的验证逻辑时，使用运行时声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const props = defineProps({&#10;  score: {&#10;    type: Number,&#10;    required: true,&#10;    validator: (value: number) =&gt; value &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; value &lt;= 100,&#10;  },&#10;  email: {&#10;    type: String,&#10;    validator: (value: string) =&gt; /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(value),&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type: Number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    validator: (value: number) => value >= 0 &#x26;&#x26; value &#x3C;= 100,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  email: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    validator: (value: string) => /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(value),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型声明</td>\n<td>完整 TypeScript 支持、编译时检查</td>\n<td>不支持运行时 validator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时声明</td>\n<td>支持 validator、默认值更灵活</td>\n<td>TypeScript 推断有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"v-model\">v-model</h2><h3 id=\"基本-v-model\">基本 v-model</h3><p><code>v-model</code> 是 <code>modelValue</code> prop 和 <code>update:modelValue</code> 事件的语法糖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 父组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;CustomInput v-model=&quot;searchText&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 等价于 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;CustomInput :model-value=&quot;searchText&quot; @update:model-value=&quot;searchText = $event&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 父组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;CustomInput v-model=\"searchText\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- 等价于 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;CustomInput :model-value=\"searchText\" @update:model-value=\"searchText = $event\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 子组件 CustomInput.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const model = defineModel&lt;string&gt;({ required: true });&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;input :value=&quot;model&quot; @input=&quot;model = ($event.target as HTMLInputElement).value&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 子组件 CustomInput.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const model = defineModel&#x3C;string>({ required: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input :value=\"model\" @input=\"model = ($event.target as HTMLInputElement).value\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多个-v-model\">多个 v-model</h3><p>一个组件可以绑定多个 <code>v-model</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 父组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const first = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;&#39;);&#10;const last = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;UserForm v-model:first-name=&quot;first&quot; v-model:last-name=&quot;last&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 父组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const first = ref&#x3C;string>('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const last = ref&#x3C;string>('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;UserForm v-model:first-name=\"first\" v-model:last-name=\"last\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 子组件 UserForm.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const firstName = defineModel&lt;string&gt;(&#39;firstName&#39;, { required: true });&#10;const lastName = defineModel&lt;string&gt;(&#39;lastName&#39;, { required: true });&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;input v-model=&quot;firstName&quot; placeholder=&quot;名&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input v-model=&quot;lastName&quot; placeholder=&quot;姓&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 子组件 UserForm.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const firstName = defineModel&#x3C;string>('firstName', { required: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const lastName = defineModel&#x3C;string>('lastName', { required: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input v-model=\"firstName\" placeholder=\"名\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input v-model=\"lastName\" placeholder=\"姓\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Parent[&quot;父组件&quot;]&#10;    Child[&quot;UserForm&quot;]&#10;    Parent --&gt; |&quot;:first-name&quot;| Child&#10;    Parent --&gt; |&quot;:last-name&quot;| Child&#10;    Child --&gt; |&quot;update:firstName&quot;| Parent&#10;    Child --&gt; |&quot;update:lastName&quot;| Parent\">flowchart LR\n    Parent[\"父组件\"]\n    Child[\"UserForm\"]\n    Parent --&gt; |\":first-name\"| Child\n    Parent --&gt; |\":last-name\"| Child\n    Child --&gt; |\"update:firstName\"| Parent\n    Child --&gt; |\"update:lastName\"| Parent</pre><h3 id=\"v-model-修饰符\">v-model 修饰符</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const [model, modifiers] = defineModel&lt;string&gt;({&#10;  set(value) {&#10;    if (modifiers.capitalize) {&#10;      return value.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + value.slice(1);&#10;    }&#10;    return value;&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const [model, modifiers] = defineModel&#x3C;string>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  set(value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (modifiers.capitalize) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return value.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + value.slice(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 使用修饰符 --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;CustomInput v-model.capitalize=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 使用修饰符 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;CustomInput v-model.capitalize=\"text\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件声明\">事件声明</h2><h3 id=\"defineemits\">defineEmits</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{&#10;  change: [value: string];&#10;  delete: [id: number];&#10;  submit: [data: { name: string; email: string }];&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&#10;function handleSubmit() {&#10;  emit(&#39;submit&#39;, { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39; });&#10;}&#10;&#10;function handleDelete(id: number) {&#10;  emit(&#39;delete&#39;, id);&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  change: [value: string];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  delete: [id: number];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  submit: [data: { name: string; email: string }];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function handleSubmit() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emit('submit', { name: 'Alice', email: 'alice@example.com' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function handleDelete(id: number) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emit('delete', id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"事件验证\">事件验证</h3><p>事件也可以进行运行时验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const emit = defineEmits({&#10;  submit(data: { name: string; email: string }) {&#10;    return data.name.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; data.email.includes(&#39;@&#39;);&#10;  },&#10;  change(value: string) {&#10;    return value.length &lt;= 100;&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  submit(data: { name: string; email: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return data.name.length > 0 &#x26;&#x26; data.email.includes('@');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  change(value: string) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return value.length &#x3C;= 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件设计最佳实践\">事件设计最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使用过去式命名</td>\n<td><code>deleted</code> 而非 <code>delete</code>（已完成的动作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用现在时命名</td>\n<td><code>update:xxx</code>（正在发生的变化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>携带必要数据</td>\n<td>事件应包含接收方需要的所有信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免过度 emit</td>\n<td>相关数据合并为一次 emit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{&#10;  &#39;update:filters&#39;: [filters: FilterState];&#10;  selected: [item: ListItem];&#10;  &#39;page-changed&#39;: [page: number, size: number];&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'update:filters': [filters: FilterState];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  selected: [item: ListItem];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'page-changed': [page: number, size: number];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Props 使用类型声明模式获得完整 TypeScript 支持，<code>withDefaults</code> 设置默认值</li>\n<li>运行时声明支持 <code>validator</code> 函数，适合复杂验证场景</li>\n<li><code>v-model</code> 是 prop + emit 的语法糖，<code>defineModel</code>（3.4+）大幅简化实现</li>\n<li>一个组件支持多个 <code>v-model</code> 绑定，通过参数名区分</li>\n<li><code>defineEmits</code> 声明组件的事件契约，支持类型安全和运行时验证</li>\n<li>遵循单向数据流：props 向下、events 向上</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Props 与事件","id":"props-与事件"},{"level":2,"text":"组件通信基础","id":"组件通信基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Props 验证","id":"props-验证"},{"level":3,"text":"类型声明","id":"类型声明"},{"level":3,"text":"运行时验证","id":"运行时验证"},{"level":2,"text":"v-model","id":"v-model"},{"level":3,"text":"基本 v-model","id":"基本-v-model"},{"level":3,"text":"多个 v-model","id":"多个-v-model"},{"level":3,"text":"v-model 修饰符","id":"v-model-修饰符"},{"level":2,"text":"事件声明","id":"事件声明"},{"level":3,"text":"defineEmits","id":"defineemits"},{"level":3,"text":"事件验证","id":"事件验证"},{"level":2,"text":"事件设计最佳实践","id":"事件设计最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"script setup 语法糖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/script-setup"},"next":{"title":"插槽与渲染函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/slots-and-render-functions"}}